`nr` is the helper CLI for this **neter** application. Run it from the project
root; most commands also work from a subdirectory.

- Detected persistence stack: **{{.Kind}}**{{if .IsSQLC}} (PostgreSQL + pgx + sqlc){{end}}{{if .IsEnt}} (legacy Ent + MySQL){{end}}
